entID":"1710611001","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"喂，你们两个，鬼鬼祟祟地在这里在干什么呢？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:3:1710611002:1":{"key":"say:3:1710611002:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611002","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"唔……昨天转了整整一天没有结果，所以今天来了其他地方……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1710611003:1":{"key":"say:4:1710611003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不对不对，又被你带偏了！这话应该我问你们！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1710611004:1":{"key":"say:5:1710611004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你不是在找隐士调查线索吗？怎么来猎场玩了，还带着格温妮丝。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1710611005:1":{"key":"say:6:1710611005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你告诉小狐狸，翅膀这一线索与王子在狮心猎场中秘密豢养的...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1710611006:1":{"key":"say:7:1710611006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……有意思。鹰啊，那些长着翅膀的家伙，它们会和狐狸抢猎物呢。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1710611007:1":{"key":"say:8:1710611007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你们该不会是想溜进猎场吧？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:9:1710611007":{"key":"choice_prompt:9:1710611007","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1710611007","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你们该不会是想溜进猎场吧？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1710611008:1":{"key":"say:10:1710611008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"咳咳，本狐知道一条绝对不会被人发现的秘密通道！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1710611009:1":{"key":"say:12:1710611009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"等等！小狐狸，你为什么会知道猎场的秘密通道？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1710611010:1":{"key":"say:13:1710611010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我之前告诉过你们呀！我是某位国王的爱宠！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1710611011:1":{"key":"say:15:1710611011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1710611011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"他可喜欢我了！他当年打猎、宴会，甚至巡视军务都离不开我...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:16:1710611011":{"key":"choice_prompt:16:1710611011","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"16","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1710611011","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"他可喜欢我了！他当年打猎、宴会，甚至巡视军务都离不开我，非要带着我！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","docu